{"reviewId": "426066534_89ygddkMd", "review": {"abstract": "除了大宗商品的产能周期，大宗商品价格一定与中周期或者固定资产投资趋势的更短周期相关，我们以国外论文的称呼方式，称其为超级周期。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterUid": 16, "content": "回过头来看，我没有理解超级周期和产能周期真正的区别点在哪", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "19488-19551", "createTime": 1780361437, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "426066534_89ygddkMd", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "“一个康波周期大宗商品价格波动的内部嵌套着两个大宗商品的产能周期，每个产能周期25～30年。而在产能周期运动的同时，大宗商品存在18～20年的超级波动周期，超级周期的大趋势服从康波和产能周期，但也存在自我的价格波动特征。一个超级周期内部存在三个显著的小级别周期波动，我们称其为商品的涛动周期，因为这一周期类似于我们理解的太阳黑子周期中的厄尔尼诺现象。”\n我理解的是产能周期是供需关系波动周期，而超级周期是价格周期，投资要看价格周期，而价格周期可以依据产能周期进行推断。", "reviewId": "426066534_89ygddkMd", "commentId": "426066534_89ygddkMd_c923101888_8bIIjJTHB", "userVid": 923101888, "createTime": 1787998417, "likesCount": 3, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 923101888, "name": "Arielle", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0029-r293_JZtuL0NGyxEBGj7hf8/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "Arielle", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}}, {"content": "👍厉害啊，第一次看就抓住了主要区别", "reviewId": "426066534_89ygddkMd", "toCommentId": "426066534_89ygddkMd_c923101888_8bIIjJTHB", "toUserVid": 923101888, "commentId": "426066534_89ygddkMd_c426066534_8bIJ1wcbw", "userVid": 426066534, "createTime": 1787999064, "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 923101888, "name": "Arielle", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0029-r293_JZtuL0NGyxEBGj7hf8/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "Arielle", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}}], "dislikeCount": 0, "synckey": 1793029137}